OL,3,GNEWSA'No doubt' woman killed by
OL,4,Afriends, say prosecutors
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors have been told there should be
OL,7,Fno doubt in their minds that a
OL,8,Fvulnerable woman was stabbed and
OL,9,Fsmothered with a pillow by her friends
OL,10,Fin her own home.
OL,12,FProsecutors told a trial that Helen
OL,13,FBloomfield, 52, was murdered by Amy
OL,14,FKeely, 40, and Charlotte James, 29, at
OL,15,Fher flat in Braintree, Essex, in March
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FKeely, of St Michael's Lane in the
OL,19,Ftown, denied she ever bragged about
OL,20,Fkilling Bloomfield.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
